T*
(This document provides comprehensive documentation for a gesture-controlled) Tj
T*
(robot) Tj
T*
(system designed for PG-level academic projects. The system integrates five major) Tj
T*
(components:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(• Computer Vision \\(MediaPipe\\) for hand gesture recognition) Tj
T*
(• Deep Learning \\(Transformer Encoder\\) for temporal sequence modeling) Tj
T*
(• Natural Language Processing \\(SpaCy\\) for gesture-to-command translation) Tj
T*
(• Blockchain \\(Ethereum/Ganache\\) for immutable audit trails) Tj
T*
(• Robot Simulation \\(Webots\\) for virtual validation) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The system enables users to control a simulated TurtleBot3 robot using hand) Tj
T*
(gestures captured via webcam, with all commands logged on a local blockchain) Tj
T*
(for security and provenance tracking.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Key Features:) Tj
T*
(- Real-time gesture recognition \\(<300ms latency\\)) Tj
T*
(- 5-10 distinct gesture classes \\(forward, backward, left, right, stop, etc.\\)) Tj
T*
(- Immutable command audit trail via smart contracts) Tj
T*
(- 3D robot simulation with realistic physics) Tj
T*
(- Modular, extensible architecture) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(================================================================================) Tj
ET
endstream
