(2. SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE OVERVIEW) Tj
T*
(================================================================================) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The system follows a pipeline architecture with five distinct phases:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(┌─────────────┐    ┌─────────�) Tj
T*
(��───┐    ┌─────────────┐) Tj
T*
(│   PHASE 1   │───▶│   PHASE 2   │───▶│   PHASE 3  ) Tj
T*
(│) Tj
T*
(│ Perception  │    │  AI Model   │    │    NLP      │) Tj
T*
(│  \\(OpenCV +  │    │\\(Transformer\\)│    │  \\(SpaCy\\)    │) Tj
T*
(│  MediaPipe\\) │    │             │    │             │) Tj
T*
(└─────────────┘    └─────────�) Tj
T*
(��───┘    └─────────────┘) Tj
T*
(                                            │) Tj
T*
(                          ┌─────────────────) Tj
T*
(┼─────────────────┐) Tj
T*
(                          ▼                                   ▼) Tj
T*
(                   ┌─────────────┐               ) Tj
T*
(     ┌─────────────┐) Tj
T*
(                   │   PHASE 4   │                     │   PHASE 5   │) Tj
T*
(                   │ Blockchain  │                     │ Simulation  │) Tj
T*
(                   │  \\(Ganache\\)  │                     │ ) Tj
T*
(\\(Webots\\)   │) Tj
T*
(                   └─────────────┘               ) Tj
T*
(     └─────────────┘) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Data Flow:) Tj
T*
(1. Webcam captures hand gestures at 30 FPS) Tj
T*
(2. MediaPipe extracts 21 3D hand landmarks per frame) Tj
T*
(3. Landmarks are buffered into 30-60 frame sequences) Tj
T*
(4. Transformer Encoder classifies the gesture sequence) Tj
T*
(5. NLP module converts gesture class to robot command) Tj
T*
(6. Command is logged on blockchain for audit trail) Tj
T*
(7. Robot executes the command in Webots simulation) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(================================================================================) Tj
T*
(3. PHASE 1: ENVIRONMENT AND PERCEPTION SETUP) Tj
T*
(================================================================================) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
