T*
(-------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Required Python version: 3.10+) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Install dependencies:) Tj
T*
(```bash) Tj
T*
(pip install opencv-python mediapipe torch torchvision web3 spacy) Tj
T*
(python -m spacy download en_core_web_sm) Tj
ET
endstream
