T*
(The HandTracker class uses MediaPipe Hands to detect and track hand landmarks) Tj
T*
(in real-time. Key features:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(• Detects up to 2 hands simultaneously) Tj
T*
(• Extracts 21 3D landmarks per hand \\(X, Y, Z coordinates\\)) Tj
T*
(• Normalizes coordinates for scale and position invariance) Tj
T*
(• Provides confidence scores for detection quality) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Landmark Structure:) Tj
T*
(- Landmarks 0-4: Thumb \\(CMC, MCP, IP, TIP\\)) Tj
T*
(- Landmarks 5-8: Index finger) Tj
T*
(- Landmarks 9-12: Middle finger) Tj
T*
(- Landmarks 13-16: Ring finger) Tj
T*
(- Landmarks 17-20: Pinky finger) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Normalization Process:) Tj
T*
(1. Center landmarks around wrist \\(landmark 0\\)) Tj
T*
(2. Scale by maximum distance from wrist) Tj
T*
(3. Result: Position and scale-invariant features) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
