(------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(File: src/transformer_model.py) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The GestureTransformer class implements a Transformer Encoder for temporal) Tj
T*
(sequence classification. Architecture:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Input Layer:) Tj
T*
(- Input: [batch_size, seq_len, 63] \\(landmark features\\)) Tj
T*
(- Linear projection: 63 → d_model \\(128 or 256\\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Positional Encoding:) Tj
T*
(- Sinusoidal position embeddings) Tj
T*
(- Encodes temporal order of frames) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Transformer Encoder:) Tj
T*
(- Multi-Head Self-Attention \\(8 heads\\)) Tj
T*
(- Feed-Forward Network \\(d_ff = 4 × d_model\\)) Tj
T*
(- Layer Normalization + Residual Connections) Tj
T*
(- Dropout \\(p=0.1\\) for regularization) Tj
T*
(- Stack of 4-6 encoder layers) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Classification Head:) Tj
T*
(- Global Average Pooling over sequence) Tj
T*
(- Linear layer: d_model → num_classes) Tj
T*
(- Softmax activation for probabilities) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Hyperparameters:) Tj
T*
(- d_model: 128 or 256) Tj
T*
(- num_heads: 8) Tj
T*
(- num_layers: 4-6) Tj
T*
(- d_ff: 512 or 1024) Tj
T*
(- dropout: 0.1) Tj
T*
(- learning_rate: 1e-4 \\(Adam optimizer\\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4.2 Training on Google Colab) Tj
T*
(----------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(File: notebooks/train_transformer.ipynb) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The Jupyter notebook provides:) Tj
T*
(- Data loading and preprocessing) Tj
T*
(- Model definition and initialization) Tj
T*
(- Training loop with validation) Tj
T*
(- Learning rate scheduling \\(CosineAnnealingLR\\)) Tj
T*
(- Early stopping \\(patience=10\\)) Tj
T*
(- Model checkpointing) Tj
T*
(- Performance visualization) Tj
T*
() Tj
ET
endstream
