(================================================================================) Tj
T*
(11. PERFORMANCE METRICS AND TESTING) Tj
T*
(================================================================================) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(11.1 Latency Requirements) Tj
T*
(-------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Target: < 300ms end-to-end latency) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Breakdown:) Tj
T*
(- Frame capture: ~33ms \\(30 FPS\\)) Tj
T*
(- Landmark extraction: ~20ms) Tj
T*
(- Model inference: ~50-100ms) Tj
T*
(- NLP processing: ~5ms) Tj
T*
(- Blockchain logging: ~50-100ms \\(async\\)) Tj
T*
(- Robot command: ~10ms) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Total: ~170-270ms \\(within target\\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(11.2 Accuracy Metrics) Tj
T*
(---------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Target: > 95% classification accuracy) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Evaluation:) Tj
T*
(- Train/Validation/Test split: 70/15/15) Tj
T*
(- Cross-validation: 5-fold) Tj
T*
(- Confusion matrix analysis) Tj
T*
(- Per-class precision/recall) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(11.3 Stability Testing) Tj
T*
(----------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Prediction Stability:) Tj
T*
(- No flickering between classes) Tj
T*
(- Consistent predictions for held gestures) Tj
T*
(- Smooth transitions between gestures) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Test Protocol:) Tj
T*
(1. Hold each gesture for 5 seconds) Tj
T*
(2. Count prediction changes) Tj
T*
(3. Target: < 2 changes per 5 seconds) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
